<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106845" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαλλ-ᾰγή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>interchange, exchange,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					209.6
				</span></i>
			: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμους ἑλομένη τῶν κακῶν ὑπαλλαγάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					294
				</span></i>
			; 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ-</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.19.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>change</i> of régime, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.410
			</span></i>; of colour, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῆς χροιᾶς ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					15.535
				</span></i>
			; of wine with age, ib.<i><span class="en">
				629
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pledging as security, mortgage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδανείσατο ἐπὶ ὑπαλλαγῇ οἰκίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					362 ix 17
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLips.</u>
				10 ii 2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hypallage,</i> a figure of speech, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				3
			</span></i> (pl.); expld. as Rhet. equivalent of Gramm. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετωνυμία</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Orat.</u>
				27.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				8.6.23
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτίμησις</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				2.28
			</span></i>.</div>
